     1491   PROCEDURE change-view :
     1492   define input parameter p-view as character no-undo.
     1493   display
     1494   rs-view
     1495   with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1496   assign
     1497   tt-c-fin-doc.exch-rate frame Dialog-Frame
     1498   tt-c-fin-doc.exch-scale
     1499   tt-c-fin-doc.sum-doc
     1500   .
     1501   hide
     1502   f-debet
     1503   f-credit
     1504   tt-c-fin-doc.cor-acc1-value
     1505   f-cor-acc1-descr
     1506   tt-c-fin-doc.cor-acc-value
     1507   f-cor-acc-descr
     1508   tt-c-fin-doc.an-uchet-value
     1509   f-an-uchet-descr
     1510   tt-c-fin-doc.cel-nazn-value
     1511   f-cel-nazn-descr
     1512   tt-c-fin-doc.cel-nazn-value
     1513   tt-c-fin-doc.perm-date
     1514   tt-c-fin-doc.user-name-perm
     1515   tt-c-fin-doc.fact-date
     1516   tt-c-fin-doc.user-name-fact
     1517   b-exit
