     1571   ENABLE
     1572   b-quit
     1573   B-tax
     1574   B-Help
     1575   RS-view
     1576   b-receiver-view
     1577   b-payer-view
     1578   WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1579   assign
     1580   b-quit:label = "&Выход".
     1581   run hide-view-currency in this-procedure.
     1582   CASE p-view:
     1583     when "full":U then do:
     1584       IF AVAILABLE tt-c-fin-doc THEN
     1585       display
     1586       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-type
     1587       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-code
     1588       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-okpo
     1589       tt-c-fin-doc.receiver-name
